{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_06",
  "title": "瑟瑟秋华",
  "storyCode": "WB-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "323cc4764846058f18ea431515b48050eb9b4866a61ecfe2a6273f9777099e1d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "（这些人配合还真默契......到底还有多少人？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长相凶狠的生物",
      "text": "（低沉的嘶吼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众成员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "咦，这些人为什么突然间都不打了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "他们为什么要找你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "你叫什么名字？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "槐琥。槐树的槐，琥珀的琥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "槐琥......我记住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "我叫截云。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "等我回来的时候，也会来找你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "等——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "奇怪的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "还是先去抓那些坏人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人的目光在地图上游移，勾勒出一条航线。\n他看得很慢，他知道图纸上的每一寸画面，象征的是何等辽阔的土地。\n桌案一旁的茶杯里，早已没了热气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "这玉门的粗茶，还以为太傅会喝不惯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "留守这里的将士百姓喝的都是这种茶，我如何喝不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "天气还未变暖，不适宜喝这凉茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "太傅缝补天下事，却唯独没将自己的身体放在心上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "你要是倒下了，让其他人如何是好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "我若是倒下了，自然会有更优秀的后来人接替我的位置。江山代有才俊，炎国没有离不开谁的道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "流水不腐，户枢不蠹。重要的不是一人一世，而是传承。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "人生代代，自古如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "“传承”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "对我们来说，恐怕是很难理解的一个词。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "但你还是教出了无数于大炎有用的人才。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "历任录武官对武学招式的记录还留作军队的训练教材，在军务上，连我也受过你不少指点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "可归根结底，我，我们，各自那一技之长，还是以人为师。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "重岳倒掉了杯中变凉的茶水，又重新添上热茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "多谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "我们什么时候也变得这样生疏了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "当年一同挑灯议事，以剑为笔指点江山，从未忘怀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "但身份毕竟不同昔日。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "是我有些冒昧了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "宗师今日竟会主动来找我，应该不只是叙旧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "的确。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "我是来与太傅告别。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "林特使，又见面了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "上一次见面，好像才是两天前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "在我看来，这两天发生的事，已经比过去二十年都多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "现在想一想，前天你出手，与其说是救我，不如说是拦住我不让我继续追查。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "那也算救你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "只是听说龙门近卫局派来了一位临时督察，负责两城对接的治安事宜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "这两天你为了查案在集市和铸剑坊闹出的动静，我实在和眼前这样一位年轻的姑娘对不上号。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "林特使从一开始就锁定了我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不，是在刚刚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "在你出现在这里之前，我都并不确定这些事情出自你的手笔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "仅仅是怀疑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "怀疑就够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "很“特别”的行事风格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我一直都这样。你是想说“不够光明磊落”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你作为玉门的老人，做的这许多事，未必就体面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "林特使骂的是。不过你倒是说说，“许多事”，具体指哪些？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "勾结山海众，伪造流寇截杀信使的现场，再上演一出袭击我的戏码，将已经调换的假天灾数据“变成真的”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "同时还另外找人盗走宗师佩剑，掩人耳目。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "盗剑在我的意料之外，不然也不会有昨天晚上的事情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "但能算到调换数据这步，林特使聪慧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "多亏你还留有一点仁慈，没有真的杀了信使队伍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "那是否也能让我问一个问题——为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "特使想必已经有答案了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你对平祟侯有怨，就要引一场天灾，毁掉整座玉门城？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "我们和左宣辽，不只是一同出生入死的交情。“怨”这个字，太轻了点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "左宣辽，也将我们看得太轻了点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "林特使，是龙门人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "听说是个好地方，很繁华，只可惜，从来没去过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "玉门你也看到了，常年穿行在大漠。冒着天灾送回军情急报，在茫茫沙海连续独行几个日夜寻找水源......你肯定没有经历过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "戍守边疆，保家卫国，这些事情，总要有人做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "玉门的军人和百姓，绝大多数都不是本地人，我们离开家乡，扎根在这儿，也从没怨过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "左宣辽不该忘了，玉门成为大炎最坚固的屏障，不是他一个人的功劳，他有什么资格赶这些为玉门流过血的人走？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你大概是误会了平祟侯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "那宗师他，为何要离开玉门？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "所以我更不理解，你为什么打算亲手毁掉自己守护了这么多年的城市？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "你以为，千百年来，玉门遭受过多少次天灾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "区区一场天灾，不仅不会毁了玉门，还能重新让这里的人们上下一心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......疯子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "仓库一角，两个年轻人面色憔悴，愁眉苦脸地缩着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "大小齐......你们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "其他人呢？守军和信使怎么样了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的镖客",
      "text": "就在刚刚，被铸剑坊的孟老头，放走了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "没事就好，没事就好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的镖客",
      "text": "小......小姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的镖客",
      "text": "这趟镖，我们没护好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的镖客",
      "text": "我们压根没弄清楚什么情况，队伍里铸剑坊的那几个人突然就出手打晕了我们，醒来的时候就在仓库里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的镖客",
      "text": "他们到底想干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "三两句说不清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "行了！一个个都哭丧着脸干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的镖客",
      "text": "这可是咱们行裕物流的第一趟活儿，就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "第一趟活儿，就遇上这么件大事，说明我们行裕物流未来的生意小不了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "别愁眉苦脸哭哭啼啼的，快跟我走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "剑的下落，有了些眉目。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "其实从一开始，你就有数。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "一点私心，瞒不过太傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "人难免有私心的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "只要这点私心，于公义无碍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "这把剑该托付给谁，我大概有了人选。只是最后一道考验，我想去亲眼看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "当然，也得太傅允许才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "但你说的告别，应该不只是这个意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "前路未卜，后会无期，是该好好告别。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "玉门此行的终点，是京城。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "祂也快要醒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人转过身，再次将目光投向那一纸地图。在那上面，他看到了许多，想到了许多。\n他突然想问一个问题，一个作为“太傅”原本不会问出的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "你会觉得遗憾吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "聚散有时，强求圆满未必就能不留遗憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "只是偶尔会想，其实自己能做的事情并不算多......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "玉门城，本是千年前为那场狩猎而建造的堡垒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "所以玉门城的英雄，可以是出身草莽的豪杰，也可以是天资卓然的长生种，但唯独不能是巨兽的化身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "这是司岁台无论如何都要守住的秘密。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "人活着，总不能指望处处都被体谅理解......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人缓步走到老人身侧，两人望着同一幅江山图画，一时无言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "如果不出意外，玉门会在半年后靠近京城。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "地图上标出的这些位置，是玉门抵达京城前，预计要疏散百姓的地点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "如果事情发展到那一步，玉门要做好与岁兽同归于尽的准备，这是大炎必须要承担的代价。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "在二十年前，山海众现身作乱。事情平息后，早在司岁台赶来善后之前，平祟侯便找过我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "他在那时就意识到，岁兽依然是炎国的一大隐患。玉门，恐怕迟早会回归它最初的战场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "而那时，玉门不能依赖我，也不能依赖那些江湖义士。到最后，所有人都是要走的。这被许多人当作家的地方，恐怕也会灰飞烟灭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "外人只道平祟侯不念旧情，但其中的考量，他又能与谁说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "我和他，本来有一群共同的朋友......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "担重任者，不能困于私情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "二十年来的恩怨纠纷，有误会，有怨恨，但总需要一个结束。我应该亲自去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "是出于私情的请求，不敢说求太傅体谅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......但我并非不通人情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "“朔”是那只罪兽的一部分，但“重岳”，于大炎百姓有恩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "太傅的意思......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "平祟侯的军令，是让宗师保护我的安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "宗师若能护玉门周全，我又怎会出事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "......多谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人转身离开军帐，轻轻带上了门。\n老人对屋外的方向，微微颔首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "text": "魏公这是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "城中缉寇，我也能出一份力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "顺便送宗师一程。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空气一片死寂，沙砾落在瓦檐上的声音清晰可闻。\n密闭的仓库看不到外面，林雨霞还在努力听着屋外的响动，时间一分一秒地流逝，不知远方的天灾云是否又靠近了几分。\n晚来风急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "林特使看起来很着急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "难为林特使陪我这个老头子聊到现在。你无非是猜，我可能还留着天灾信使带回来的真实数据。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "拿去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你没有理由平白无故地把东西给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "我算过了，拖到这个时候，钦天监即使拿到真实数据，玉门也不可能避过这场天灾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "另外，想向林特使说明，整件事情因我一人而起，被带走的那些武人兄弟的确是无辜的，希望林特使明察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "置一城的人于危难，难得你还有“无辜”的概念。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "天灾人祸，一码归一码。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你拖延我到现在，应该还另有目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "当然。这种时候，不该做浪费时间的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "原本答应了要帮一位故人出城。昨晚铸剑坊出事后，也只能爽约了。只好多吸引些注意力在我自己身上，好让她顺利出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "那个盗剑的人？我记得你说盗剑也在你的意料之外......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "林特使确实是聪明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "这又是一笔糊涂账，就不足为外人道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "让该走的人走，该算账的人算清账。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "林特使，拿到了想要的东西，就赶紧走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "其实还有一点，你没有说到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "和我有仇有怨的，可不止是左宣辽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "特意约这个时间，这个地点，也是想让另一拨人找过来，顺便把另一笔旧账给了了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "text": "到处躲，找你不容易。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "text": "你背弃了我们的合作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "山海众昨天晚上潜入铸剑坊，难道不是想杀我灭口？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "text": "抢回那个小姑娘手里的数据，这个人交给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众成员",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "还有啊，我想你可能是误会了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人解开挂在腰间的布包，掏出那把平凡无奇，黝黑的铁锤。\n他看着面前的山海众，几乎是咬着牙说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "我怎么可能躲呢，我巴不得，早点结果了你们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
